type: software
title: "V-BAR: Verified Benchmark for Autonomous Rendezvous"
abstract: >-
  A headless, pip-installable benchmark for testing classical, reinforcement learning and
  LLM spacecraft controllers on rendezvous and proximity operations, with and without
  safety filters.
